1	// Satellites seated at the pins their wires touch. A chain leaves an anchor
2	// pin along the pin's facing: an element posed along that ray stands in the
3	// pin's row, clear of the anchor by a pin pitch; an element posed across it
4	// turns the chain into a lane — a lattice column off the pin, clear of the
5	// anchor by a pitch past the lattice cells the element covers (a part keeps
6	// half the scope's gap besides) — and stacks along it. Each next element
7	// clears the one before by a pitch. Every seated point sits on the lattice:
8	// a part's or a tag's centre, a symbol's connection point.
